</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Christian, dost thou feel them,</l><l>How they work within,</l><l>Striving, tempting, luring,</l><l>Goading into sin?</l><l>Christian, never tremble,</l><l>Never be downcast;</l><l>Gird thee for the conflict;</l><l>Watch, and pray, and fast.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Christian, dost thou hear them,</l><l>How they speak thee fair?</l><l>“Always fast and vigil,</l><l>Always watch and prayer?”</l><l>Christian, answer boldly,</l><l>“While I breathe I pray“;</l><l>Peace shall follow battle,</l><l>Night shall end in day.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
